 "manufacturer": "Zhuhai Hongjiacheng Technology",
 "title": "Bidirectional 3.3 V low-capacitance ESD protection diode, SOD-323",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.1",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "A two-terminal bidirectional TVS diode for ESD and surge protection of 3.3 V signal lines, in the SOD-323 package. It stands off 3.3 V in either polarity, breaks down between 5 V and 8 V, and loads the line with 1 pF typical, 1.5 pF at most. It withstands ±30 kV air and contact discharge to IEC 61000-4-2 and a 20 A 8/20 µs surge, clamping to 19 V or less at that current. Applications listed for it: RS232/RS485 and CAN/LIN bus lines, LED lighting modules, general-purpose I/O and portable instruments.",
